@startuml UC5_ManageTeam_UseCase
title UC5 - Manage Pokemon Team (Use Case Diagram)
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9E6
  BorderColor #333333
}

note "**Under Development**\nNo dedicated TeamScreen exists.\nTeam management is handled inline\nvia CatchService and BattleScreen." as N1

actor Player

rectangle "Team Management System" {
  (View PokemonTeam)
  (CatchService adds Pokemon) as UC_Catch
  (BattleScreen switch Pokemon) as UC_Switch
  (StoryService heals team) as UC_Heal
}

Player --> (View PokemonTeam)
Player --> UC_Catch
Player --> UC_Switch
Player --> UC_Heal

note bottom of UC_Catch : via catch in battle
note bottom of UC_Switch : during battle
note bottom of UC_Heal : at Pokemon Center

note right of (View PokemonTeam)
  Planned features:
  - Swap positions
  - Release Pokemon
  - Box management
end note

@enduml
